{
 "about": "The squadron-launch cinematic (M8-T03, D81, AC2): the squadron's Starfuries (the AI flights and the player's two wingmen) launch from their wing's Cobra arm in M7-T08's sequence, flip, light their engines and fly to their slots in the formation, which hangs 'form_up.radius_m' out from the drum's axis at 'form_up.angle_deg' (the station's frame, away from the spine), level with the arm; then the player launches alone from 'player_door' with the exterior shots of data/launch/exterior_launch.json and its hand-off ends the cinematic. 'flights' counts the squadron's flights of three, the player's own included. The camera is filmed from outside the station only, in phases as cobra_launch.json's, each following one fighter of the launch ('follows': lead, the first fighter; wave2, the second wave's first; last, the last one). Extra actors: 'formation' (the formation's anchor: -z its heading, +y away from the station) and 'station'. 'fallback' plays whenever no shot is on screen before the player's launch.",
